msgid "Tests per app"
msgstr "Pruebas por app"

#: .\templates\admin\ops\test_summary.html:294
msgid ""
"Measured against the app with the most, not against the total: with thirteen"
" apps, measuring against the total leaves every bar glued to the axis."
msgstr ""
"Se mide contra la app que más tiene, no contra el total: con trece apps, "
"medir contra el total deja todas las barras pegadas al eje."

