msgid "— choose —"
msgstr "— elegir —"

#: .\templates\dashboard\pages\documents\code_gen\summary_composer.html:137
msgid "Seal"
msgstr "Sellar"

#: .\templates\dashboard\pages\documents\code_gen\summary_composer.html:140
msgid ""
"Sealing computes the master hash over the members. It never covers the "
"summary itself — that document does not exist yet when the hash is computed."
msgstr ""
"Sellar calcula el master hash sobre los miembros. Nunca cubre al propio "
"resumen: ese documento todavía no existe cuando se calcula el hash."

#: .\templates\dashboard\pages\documents\code_gen\summary_composer.html:151
msgid "Sealing and sending…"
msgstr "Sellando y enviando…"

#: .\templates\dashboard\pages\documents\code_gen\summary_composer.html:153
msgid "Seal and send to blockchain"
msgstr "Sellar y enviar a la cadena de bloques"

#: .\templates\dashboard\pages\documents\code_gen\summary_composer.html:157
msgid "Sealing…"
msgstr "Sellando…"

#: .\templates\dashboard\pages\documents\code_gen\summary_composer.html:158
msgid "Seal only"
msgstr "Solo sellar"

#: .\templates\dashboard\pages\documents\code_gen\summary_composer.html:163
msgid ""
"Sending is free: OpenTimestamps bundles thousands of hashes into a single "
"Bitcoin transaction. Only the hash travels, never the document."
msgstr ""
"Enviar es gratis: OpenTimestamps junta miles de huellas en una sola "
"transacción de Bitcoin. Solo viaja la huella, nunca el documento."

#: .\templates\dashboard\pages\documents\code_gen\summary_composer.html:172
msgid "Blockchain"
msgstr "Cadena de bloques"

#: .\templates\dashboard\pages\documents\code_gen\summary_composer.html:178
msgid ""
"A sealed summary can be sent later: the hash is the same one. The proof is "
"born pending and matures into a Bitcoin block within a few hours, on its own"
" — nothing needs re-stamping."
msgstr ""
"Un resumen sellado se puede enviar después: la huella es la misma. La prueba"
" nace pendiente y madura sola hasta un bloque de Bitcoin en unas horas, sin "
"reestampar nada."

#: .\templates\dashboard\pages\documents\code_gen\summary_composer.html:184
msgid "Send to blockchain"
msgstr "Enviar a la cadena de bloques"

#: .\templates\dashboard\pages\documents\code_gen\summary_composer.html:200
msgid "Summary document"
msgstr "Documento del resumen"

#: .\templates\dashboard\pages\documents\code_gen\summary_composer.html:204
#: .\templates\dashboard\pages\documents\code_gen\summary_composer.html:411
msgid "Issued"
msgstr "Emitido"

#: .\templates\dashboard\pages\documents\code_gen\summary_composer.html:204
#: .\templates\dashboard\pages\documents\code_gen\summary_composer.html:412
msgid "Not issued"
msgstr "Sin emitir"

#: .\templates\dashboard\pages\documents\code_gen\summary_composer.html:209
#| msgid ""
#| "The box also has its own PDF: it carries the master hash, the barcode of "
#| "every member, and the QR of the anchor page. It does not wait for the "
#| "blockchain — that QR points at a page that updates itself, so nothing needs "
#| "re-stamping when the Bitcoin block arrives."
msgid ""
"The summary has its own PDF: it carries the master hash, the barcode of "
"every member, and the QR of the anchor page. It does not wait for the "
"blockchain — that QR points at a page that updates itself, so nothing needs "
"re-stamping when the Bitcoin block arrives."
msgstr ""
"El resumen tiene su propio PDF: lleva el master hash, el código de barras de"
" cada miembro y el QR de la página de anclaje. No espera a la cadena de "
"bloques: ese QR apunta a una página que se actualiza sola, así que no hay "
"que reestampar nada cuando llegue el bloque de Bitcoin."

#: .\templates\dashboard\pages\documents\code_gen\summary_composer.html:214
msgid "Issuing…"
msgstr "Emitiendo…"

#: .\templates\dashboard\pages\documents\code_gen\summary_composer.html:217
